[signal arg="CONVOSTART"]
set {ZiphEnlighten} = false
Ziphilix: BANANAS ARENT REAL YOU INVENTED THEM IN A DREAM
Ziphilix: WAKE UP
Ziphilix: THE MOON SCREAMED LAST NIGHT. CORD STRINGS ANSWERED
Ziphilix: WAKE UP
- Are you my client?
	Ziphilix: CLIENT CLIENT YES HAVENT HAVENT BUT I FOUND TEETH IN THE FLOOR YES YES
	Ziphilix: I WAS ZIPHILIX WHILE I HEAR A KNOCK
	Ziphilix: I WAS THE PROFANE MAN
	Ziphilix: I MIGHT BE THE CRYING SON
	Ziphilix: I WILL BE THE ENTROPY YES YES GOOD
	Virtue: (I think they want me to speak)
	- The contract
		Virtue: Im here to discuss our contract...
		Virtue: You want me to be the defence attorney of humanity?
		Ziphilix: PARDON WELL YES YES IVE EXCUSED FOUND DOOR IN THE MELTING SUN
		(I think I'll take that as a yes?)
		Ziphilix: IVE ONLY STOPPED BY TO DROP OFF THE CRATES I DONT MEAN TO STAY LONG
		(I need to find a way of communicating with them... Maybe I shouldnt use too many words..)
		Ziphilix: I SHORTENED WORDS TO SAVE TIME, I ONLY WANT ICE
		if {BonestoZIPH} == true:
			Virtue: You know something about a Solar Marker?
			Ziphilix: ...
			Ziphilix: YOUVE SPOKEN TO THE ONE OF MANY BONES
			Ziphilix: I SHALL ENLIGHTEN YOU
			Ziphilix: SPIRITS SPEAK IN NO TONGUES WITHOUT THE OSCILATING TONES IN THEIR STRINGS
			Ziphilix: ALAS THE PEACEFUL IS THE MOST CHAOTIC
			set {ZiphEnlighten} = true
			jump DialogueSection
		else:
			label DialogueSection
			- Humanity? Thoughts?
				Ziphilix: MY EGO ITS DESTRUCTION AND THE ELEGANT RECYCLING THATS TO COME
				Ziphilix: HUMANITY IS WHOLE IN NEEDS WHOLE IN NEEDS
				Ziphilix: FEED
				(I should carefully examine what they've said.. If I get this wrong I might offend them)
				- So Good?
					Ziphilix: FEED FEED FEED FEED
					Ziphilix: YOUR IS CONQUERED OVEN MITTS
					(It seems what I just said offended them.)
					set {Warnings} += 1.0
					jump DialogueSection
				- So Bad?
					Ziphilix: AND THE WINNER HAS HIS TROPHY!
					Ziphilix: NEXT GOLFER UP MUST DEFEND HIMSELF FROM WINDS
					jump DialogueSection
			- Convince?
				Ziphilix: NO NO NO PLEASE DONT HURT ME
				Ziphilix: THERE IS TOO LEARN ALL FOUND IN YOU
				(Trying to convince this thing is like trying to understand someone speaking a language you've never heard in morse code)
				(I should look for emotionally charged words)
				Virtue: In my role as defence attorney I need to understand your rationale behind the allegations listed in the contract.
				Virtue: Can you articulate the basis of these allegations?
				Ziphilix: ...
				Ziphilix: THIS YES TRIAL IS MY IDEA
				Ziphilix: HUMANITY YES TAKES TOO MUCH ROOM. TOO MUCH SPACE
				Ziphilix: FUN TO REMOVE
				(Think thats about as much as I can get from this topic of conversation)
				jump DialogueSection
			- (Leave Conversation)
				(Ive had more productive conversations with a wall, but still, atleast I know the likley culprit for why im here)
				Virtue: Good talk.
				set {ZiphInteract} = false
				[signal arg="CONVOISOVER"]
				[end_timeline]